# Ekatva AI Assistant – Smart Tank Monitoring System

An AI assistant designed as a customized company-specific assistant
for Ekatva Technovation's Smart Tank Monitoring System.

## Project Objective

The Ekatva AI Assistant was designed to provide structured information
and support around the Smart Tank Monitoring System.

## Key Features

- Password-protected access
- Customized AI assistant behavior
- Company-specific instructions
- Smart Tank Monitoring System information
- Real-time level monitoring information
- Temperature and pressure monitoring information
- Smart alert system information
- Multi-tank management information
- Web dashboard and Android mobile app information

## Smart Tank Monitoring System Capabilities

### Real-Time Monitoring
Live level tracking with instant low-level alerts.

### Temperature & Pressure Monitoring
Thermal and pressure analysis with automatic alerts.

### Smart Alert System
Instant mobile and web notifications for abnormal conditions.

### Multi-Tank Management
Centralized dashboard for multiple tanks and locations.

### Web Dashboard + Mobile App
Live status, alarms, trends, and reports.

